      "text": "Figure 1: Motivating example comparing Individual Exploration vs Competitive Debate on Django issue 11999. Under Individual Exploration, the agent focuses on django/db/models/base.py:_get_FIELD_display (lines 939-944) attempting runtime fallback display logic (marked \"Wrong place!\"). Under Competitive Debate, the debate identifies and modifies db/models/fields/__init__.py:Field.contribute_to_class (lines 765-767) to check for an existing method before attaching default implementation, exactly matching the Golden Patch (marked \"Correct place!\").",
